rl":null,"created_at":"2016-02-23T17:06:20Z","assignee":{"login":"hermione521","id":1552651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTI2NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1552651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521","html_url":"https://github.com/hermione521","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/191454806","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/738#issuecomment-191454806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/738","id":191454806,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE5MTQ1NDgwNg==","user":{"login":"AustinSchuh","id":294043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinSchuh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-03-02T22:07:19Z","updated_at":"2016-03-02T22:07:19Z","body":"I just ran into this today.\n\n$ ls -lah /etc/resolv.conf /etc/resolvconf/run\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   31 Sep 17 15:09 /etc/resolv.conf -> /etc/resolvconf/run/resolv.conf\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   15 Sep 17 15:09 /etc/resolvconf/run -> /run/resolvconf\n\nMaybe the intermediate symlink is failing to be resolved right?\n\nIs someone working on this?  I'm going to start taking a look since I need this to make progress on my original goal.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/191454806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AustinSchuh","id":294043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinSchuh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/191462151","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/738#issuecomment-191462151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/738","id":191462151,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE5MTQ2MjE1MQ==","user":{"login":"philwo","id":504652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDY1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo","html_url":"https://github.com/philwo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-03-02T22:25:28Z","updated_at":"2016-03-02T22:25:28Z","body":"@hermione521 has a fix for this, that's currently in code review.\n\nThe proposed thing to do is to simply add the following to LinuxSandboxedStrategy#mountUsualUnixDirs:\n\n``` java\nPath resolv = fs.getPath(\"/etc/resolv.conf\");\nif (resolv.exists() && resolv.isSymbolicLink()) {\n  Path resolvTarget = resolv.resolveSymbolicLinks();\n  mounts.put(resolvTarget, resolvTarget);\n}\n```\n\nAlternatively, we could treewalk through /etc completely and resolve + mount the targets of all symlinks found there, but this would be rather expensive, as we (currently) can't cache the results and have to do this each time we execute a spawn.\n\nWhat do you think?\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/191462151/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"philwo","id":504652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDY1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo","html_url":"https://github.com/philwo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philwo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":575405124,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NTc1NDA1MTI0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/575405124","actor":{"login":"hermione521","id":1552651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTI2NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1552651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521","html_url":"https://github.com/hermione521","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermione521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github