ommit_url":null,"created_at":"2016-03-02T22:47:06Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":575435149,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDU3NTQzNTE0OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/575435149","actor":{"login":"bsilver8192","id":2999225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTkyMjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2999225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192","html_url":"https://github.com/bsilver8192","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2016-03-02T22:47:06Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/191480103","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/738#issuecomment-191480103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/738","id":191480103,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE5MTQ4MDEwMw==","user":{"login":"AustinSchuh","id":294043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinSchuh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-03-02T22:53:54Z","updated_at":"2016-03-02T22:54:20Z","body":"@philwo  Summary: resolv.conf, maybe /etc/network/run are broken.  You'll get most of the way there with just fixing /etc/resolv.conf.  The rest may be Debian Jessie specific.\n\nI ran the following bash in a sandboxed test. (there are probably prettier ways to do this, but it works)\n\n```\nfor f in $(find /etc/ -type l)\ndo\n  if [[ ! -e ${f} ]]\n  then\n    ls -lah ${f}\n  fi  \ndone\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\n/etc/resolv.conf -> /etc/resolvconf/run/resolv.conf\n/etc/opt/brother/scanner/brscan4/Brsane4.ini -> /opt/brother/scanner/brscan4/Brsane4.ini \n/etc/opt/brother/scanner/brscan4/brsanenetdevice4.cfg -> /opt/brother/scanner/brscan4/brsanenetdevice4.cfg\n/etc/opt/brother/scanner/brscan4/models4 -> /opt/brother/scanner/brscan4/models4\n/etc/opt/brother/Printers/MFC8910DW/inf/brMFC8910DWrc -> /opt/brother/Printers/MFC8910DW/inf/brMFC8910DWrc\n/etc/cron.daily/google-chrome -> /opt/google/chrome/cron/google-chrome\n/etc/alternatives/x-www-browser -> /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable\n/etc/alternatives/google-chrome -> /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable\n/etc/alternatives/gnome-www-browser -> /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable\n/etc/resolvconf/run -> /run/resolvconf\n/etc/qmail/qmail-smtpd/log/supervise -> /var/lib/supervise/qmail-smtpd.log\n/etc/qmail/qmail-smtpd/supervise -> /var/lib/supervise/qmail-smtpd\n/etc/qmail/qmail-verify/log/supervise -> /var/lib/supervise/qmail-verify.log\n/etc/qmail/qmail-verify/supervise -> /var/lib/supervise/qmail-verify\n/etc/qmail/qmail-send/log/supervise -> /var/lib/supervise/qmail-send.log\n/etc/qmail/qmail-send/supervise -> /var/lib/supervise/qmail-send\n/etc/network/run -> /run/network\n/etc/sv/getty-5/supervise -> /var/run/sv.getty-5\n/etc/sgml/catalog -> /var/lib/sgml-base/supercatalog\n/etc/dictionaries-common/default.hash -> /usr/lib/ispell/american.hash\n/etc/dictionaries-common/ispell-default -> /var/cache/dictionaries-common/ispell-default\n```\n\nCaching treewalk results would help some.  Maybe you could also create a namespace to clone from that already has the base OS stuff as well at that point in time.\n\nThe biggest slow down on my machine seems to be the kernel lock for creating sandboxes and/or mapping files into sandboxes.  I think it would be worth looking at what's going on there and maybe talking with a kernel guy or looking for ways to hit the lock less.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/191480103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AustinSchuh","id":294043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinSchuh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSchuh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinSch